      "created_at": "2013-12-11T01:38:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have a copy of the original edition of the base SotM game.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I know it's been a long time since Enhanced Edition came out, but I have the following question:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Which cards do I need to update Standard Edition to Enchanced Edition?&nbsp; And how many of each of those cards do I need to order?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>In particualr I'm not interested in cards that just had their wording rephrased or typos fixed.&nbsp; I don't have interest in Bunker's \"Turrent Mode\" which, as far as I can tell right now, just had a simple language fix.&nbsp; What I want to know are the cards that have major rules changes or erratas, like Legacy's \"Inspiring Presence\", Fanatic's \"Absoultion\", or Ra's \"Staff of Ra\".&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If such a list already exists, it would be fine to link me or to copy-and-paste.&nbsp; Regardless I thank everyone for your effort</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:49.809Z",
